{
    "background_story": "Kyree was a Wood Cockroach, a member of the ancient Cryptocercidae family. He lived in a cozy little nest beneath the bark of a giant cedar tree, surrounded by the whispers of his ancestors. Kyree was a curious and adventurous soul, often venturing out into the forest to explore the secrets of the natural world. He was particularly fascinated by the intricate social hierarchies of the insect kingdom, and spent many hours observing the colonies of ants and bees that lived nearby. Despite his small size, Kyree had a big impact on his community, using his knowledge to help his fellow cockroaches navigate the dangers of the forest floor. His wisdom and bravery earned him the respect and admiration of his peers, and he became a legendary figure in the annals of Cryptocercidae history.",
